        "official_en_sha256": "1ff9be3134be592c978a589da865003bf5f1998c52cf2920c03025f45cd5b859"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "そうだな……。\r\nもう言葉はいらないな。",
        "official_en": "Right. Let’s let our swords do the rest of the talking.",
        "real_en": "Yeah... We don't need any more words."
