        "official_en_sha256": "6e422c4593abcabf3e56d7cedfb348a7d245dcf80fa7150d319bac8bdd58eb48"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "もっともそんなことがなくても\r\nお前との戦いは真剣勝負に決まってるけどな。",
        "official_en": "Heh, not like we’d hold back even if this wasn’t part of the trial.",
        "real_en": "Even without the trial, I'd still give you a serious fight."
      },
